{
    "title": "Obby World: Parkour Runner",
    "description": "Welcome to the dynamic and exciting world of parkour with Obby World: Parkour Runner! This action platform game invites players to conquer difficult obstacles, where each level is filled with unique tasks and bright visuals. Get ready for intense jumping, fast running and exciting adventures on platforms of varying difficulty!\r\n\r\nGame modes\r\n\r\n1. Rainbow mode\r\nThis mode immerses you in a bright and colorful platform world. All platforms are painted in rich colors, which makes the gameplay even more attractive. In this mode, it is important not only to react quickly, but also to enjoy the atmosphere that fills your adventure with light and joy on the action platform.\r\n\r\n2. Bicycle mode\r\nIn the second mode, you take control of your hero on a bicycle. Here you need to not only jump and run on the platform, but also control your transport, overcoming obstacles at high speed. Maneuver between platforms, perform tricks and collect bonuses to become a true master of parkour action platform.\r\n\r\n3. Prison Escape\r\nThis mode offers an exciting adventure where our hero ends up in prison. You need to guide him through dangerous platforms to escape to freedom. Each level requires strategic thinking and quick reactions, as various traps and enemies await you. Use your skills to overcome all the obstacles on the platform and reach your goal.\r\n\r\nCharacter Customization\r\n\r\nIn Obby World: Parkour Runner, you can change the appearance of your hero, adding personality and style to the gameplay. Customize your character to your taste and stand out among other players of the action platform. The choice of appearance is not only aesthetic, but can also open up new possibilities in the game.\r\n\r\nGameplay\r\n\r\nThe gameplay of Obby World: Parkour Runner combines elements of the platform and active fun. Each level is designed with unique obstacles that require agility and quick reactions from you. Jumping over chasms, dodging moving objects and overcoming various challenges will make your adventure in the world of the platform exciting and full of adrenaline.\r\n\r\nConclusion\r\n\r\nObby World: Parkour Runner is not just a game; it is a real playground for enthusiasts of action platform adventures. With multiple modes, bright graphics and exciting gameplay, it offers players a unique experience that will not leave you indifferent. Join our world of action platform and parkour, change your images, conquer platforms and become a master in this exciting adventure! Do not miss the chance to become a part of this exciting platformer game - start your journey to freedom and victory today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the dynamic and exciting world of parkour with Obby World: Parkour Runner! This action platform game invites players to conquer difficult obstacles, where each level is filled with unique tasks and bright visuals. Get ready for intense jumping, fast running and exciting adventures on platforms of varying difficulty!<br><br>Game modes<br><br>1. Rainbow mode<br>This mode immerses you in a bright and colorful platform world. All platforms are painted in rich colors, which makes the gameplay even more attractive. In this mode, it is important not only to react quickly, but also to enjoy the atmosphere that fills your adventure with light and joy on the action platform.<br><br>2. Bicycle mode<br>In the second mode, you take control of your hero on a bicycle. Here you need to not only jump and run on the platform, but also control your transport, overcoming obstacles at high speed. Maneuver between platforms, perform tricks and collect bonuses to become a true master of parkour action platform.<br><br>3. Prison Escape<br>This mode offers an exciting adventure where our hero ends up in prison. You need to guide him through dangerous platforms to escape to freedom. Each level requires strategic thinking and quick reactions, as various traps and enemies await you. Use your skills to overcome all the obstacles on the platform and reach your goal.<br><br>Character Customization<br><br>In Obby World: Parkour Runner, you can change the appearance of your hero, adding personality and style to the gameplay. Customize your character to your taste and stand out among other players of the action platform. The choice of appearance is not only aesthetic, but can also open up new possibilities in the game.<br><br>Gameplay<br><br>The gameplay of Obby World: Parkour Runner combines elements of the platform and active fun. Each level is designed with unique obstacles that require agility and quick reactions from you. Jumping over chasms, dodging moving objects and overcoming various challenges will make your adventure in the world of the platform exciting and full of adrenaline.<br><br>Conclusion<br><br>Obby World: Parkour Runner is not just a game; it is a real playground for enthusiasts of action platform adventures. With multiple modes, bright graphics and exciting gameplay, it offers players a unique experience that will not leave you indifferent. Join our world of action platform and parkour, change your images, conquer platforms and become a master in this exciting adventure! Do not miss the chance to become a part of this exciting platformer game - start your journey to freedom and victory today!",
